      "_key": "k0007",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "On September 26th, 2016, hundreds of people came together at the Penn Museum in Philadelphia for the third annual Forge Conference, a one-day event created and organized by O3 World. This year was filled with a diverse group of speakers who all had something valuable to share. The attendees picked up tons of tips on a variety of topics from the curated speakers from companies like Mad*Pow, Odopod, Lyft, Comcast, Slack, and NASA. Furthermore, there was a special Q&A session with Philadelphia’s mayor, Jim Kenney.",
          "_key": "k0008"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0009",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Here are some great things some people have said about the event:",
          "_key": "k0010"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0011",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Had a fantastic time at #forgeconf -big thank you to the @o3world team. You created a delightful & memorable conference/speaker experience. – ",
          "_key": "k0012"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "@alissadesigns",
          "_key": "k0013"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nMany thanks to O3 and all of the Forge Conference organizers! Such great content shared with great people. #forgeconf – ",
          "_key": "k0014"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0001"
          ],
          "text": "@lijahogan",
          "_key": "k0015"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nThx to @keitho3world @gadsbyo3world and the whole @o3world crew for hosting this fantastic #ForgeConf. Honored to be a part. – ",
          "_key": "k0016"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0002"
          ],
          "text": "@albertpoon",
          "_key": "k0017"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nSerious props to the whole @ForgeConf @o3world team for putting on such an excellent #forgeconf! Speakers & attendees were ?. Thank you!? – ",
          "_key": "k0018"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0003"
          ],
          "text": "@yopensiero",
          "_key": "k0019"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\nBig thank you to @keitho3world + the whole @ForgeConf team for an incredible day! So many inspiring people & presentations! #forgeconf – ",
          "_key": "k0020"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0004"
          ],
          "text": "@shannon_patrick",
          "_key": "k0021"
        }
      ],
